LmxxfNrApi.h (the C interface this runtime implements; compiled into Rdna2NrRuntime.dll)
  OpenNR's version of the lmxxf runtime header, received from the OpenNR maintainers. The interface design
  (LmxxfNrGetApi, the job model) is lmxxf / Kien's; this runtime only implements it. MIT License:

